# Project: Auto_Stock Codebase Review & Direct Refactoring

## Architecture
Auto_Stock is an automated stock trading and deep reinforcement learning system built on Python 3.10+.
- **Core Layer**: `core/config.py` (hierarchical configuration with SecretStr protection), `core/kiwoom_api.py` (Kiwoom 2024 REST API client, OAuth2 token manager, order/quote/balance endpoints).
- **Data Engine Layer**: `modules/data/` (`collector_price.py`, `collector_fundamental.py`, `consolidator.py`, `streamer.py`, `pipeline.py`) - OHLCV data collection, DART/Naver financial statements, Point-in-Time `merge_asof`, real-time tick streaming and candle aggregation.
- **Trading & RL Engine Layer**: `modules/engine/` (`mock_environment.py`, `hybrid_trading_env.py`, `live_learning_simulator.py`, `manual_trader.py`) - Virtual accounting with 1-KRW precision, Gymnasium 1.2.0 trading environment, live simulation.
- **Model Architecture Layer**: `modules/models/` (`feature_extractor.py`, `hybrid_policy.py`) - 1D-CNN + MLP DualStream SL feature extractor, Hybrid Actor-Critic with PPO.
- **HPO & Analysis Layer**: `modules/hpo/` (`metrics.py`, `optuna_pipeline.py`, `exporter.py`) - Financial metric evaluation (Sharpe, MDD), Optuna Bayesian HPO, atomic CSV export.
- **Test & Validation Layer**: `tests/` (18 test suites, 426 tests) - Unit, integration, and adversarial stress tests.

