## Interface Contracts & Code Layout
- **Root Directory Cleanliness**: All temporary/scrap scripts in root must be moved to `backup/` or `etc/scripts/`.
- **Lock Management & Audit Logging**: Subagents modifying files must respect lock safety and record audit trails per `GEMINI.md`.
- **Thread Safety**: Singleton configurations and token managers must employ double-checked locking with `threading.Lock()`.
- **Resource Management**: Network sessions must provide deterministic `.close()` and context managers.
- **Gymnasium 1.2.0 Standard**: Environments must return 5-tuple `(obs, reward, terminated, truncated, info)`.
